      "filename": "Kreta (GR), Amnatos, Kloster Arkadi, Katze -- 2023 -- 8621.jpg",
      "title": "File:Kreta (GR), Amnatos, Kloster Arkadi, Katze -- 2023 -- 8621.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/Kreta_%28GR%29%2C_Amnatos%2C_Kloster_Arkadi%2C_Katze_--_2023_--_8621.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
